hooks/vendor/webp.js bundles the WebP decoder of ts-webp (https://github.com/stacksjs/ts-webp), at the commit
scripts/vendor-webp.sh names. ts-webp ships no licence file of its own: its package.json and its README say it is
under the MIT License, by Chris Breuer <chris@stacksjs.org>, whose text follows.

